     3026           run wp-xmltagput   in this-procedure ( input 3, input "checkTotDoc"   , input string( buf_chk-doc.netto      ), input 0 ).
     3027           run wp-xmltagput   in this-procedure ( input 3, input "checkBruttoDoc", input string( buf_chk-doc.tot-doc    ), input 0 ).
